{
  "about": [
    "agent_eligibility(row, conditions) truth table (TR-10; D31, design 4.7, 9 #4). row is a judgment row's fields that decide it",
    "(merge onto a full state_rows.json row to validate); conditions are observation condition fields. reasons are every reason that",
    "applies, in EXCLUSION_REASONS order; eligible is reasons == []. set_batch_mismatch comes from cross-batch mapping (TR-26), never",
    "from this function. Only Trends rows in state rising or emerging and GSC rows are asked; filters (state, geo, country) are separate.",
    "Trends: confirmed, or first with trend_include_first; emerging only with trend_state=emerging; ambiguity clear; not shared_title;",
    "correspondence confirmed, or unconfirmed with strong id_evidence and trend_include_presumed; not stale, not carried_over, tier A,",
    "not unstable, control available. GSC: admission formal, not migration_suspect, not mapping_changed; correspondence never asked.",
    "A GSC row's state is its primary formal label or present, so a label short of its formal bar (a small-base surge) leaves",
    "the row present: gsc_state=surge cannot match it, and eligibility reads admission only (design 5.8)."
  ],
  "reasons_order": [
    "trend_first_only",
    "emerging_not_requested",
    "title_ambiguous",
    "shared_title",
    "correspondence_unconfirmed",
    "correspondence_presumed",
    "stale",
    "carried_over",
    "b_tier",
    "unstable",
    "control_unavailable",
    "gsc_descriptive_only",
    "migration_suspect",
    "mapping_changed",
    "set_batch_mismatch"
  ],
